th in this open environment and uncover what's happening around you. The ruins of an ancient civilization watch over you: don't meet the same fate as the Ancients.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845520/extras/fc4a05ef434861553fd09e3f9138a06f.avif?t=1764256808\" width=616 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Civilization and resource management<br></li><li>Combat with bullet hell elements<br></li><li>Frenzied encounters<br></li><li>Seven different weapon types, each with its own evolution tree and characteristics<br></li><li>Over 30 Techs that change the gameplay from match to match<br></li><li>Endless combinations of weapons and Techs<br></li><li>Unique, entirely original environment and universe<br></li><li>A hidden story to discover<br></li><li>Hidden mechanics</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2845520?t=1764256808","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2845520?t=1764256808","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845520/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764256808","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845520/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764256808","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3122160,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>NOW ON KICKSTARTER</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845520/extras/fdecacb28f306ac192ab4c34777d86cc.avif?t=1764256808\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><br>Support us on Kickstarter now and 